# Backgammon: the points (2 bytes, 14 pixels, by 60 lines, pointing down from the top or up from
# the bottom, in two colors and two monochrome patterns), the checker's disc (2 bytes by 12 lines, 10
# pixels across and 9 lines down, which draw/backgammon.c fills white or black on its place's color),
# the counts cut out of it (2 bytes by 5 lines: the digits 1 to 9 and +, 3 color pixels by 5 lines, each
# pixel two wide), the dice (2 bytes by 12 lines, white with black pips) and the doubling cube's face.
# Made for this program.

